+// The touchpad or L3+R3 during the game pauses it behind a side panel in the PS3 look: the month's
+// colour, a gliding highlight, the clock and button hints, the menu sounds. Rows: Resume, Reset
+// Game, Volume, FPS counter and Widescreen (changed on the spot with Left/Right), Settings (a
+// PS3-style list of G-Diffuser's main options in groups, L1/R1 between groups), Enhancements (the
+// full G-Diffuser menu, for everything else; the touchpad closes it) and Close Game.
+//
